<h5 class="activityhead">Android Application development workshop</h5>
<p style="padding-left: 200px;padding-right: 200px; text-align: justify;"> two-day workshop on Android Application development workshop was conducted on 21/10/2016 & 22/10/2016 with the support of IEDC cell of Marian Engineering College. The workshop was handled by three alumni of NIT Calicut. A total of 46 students from various departments attended the workshop. The session was focussed on JAVA programming, Familiarisation of Android studio and to create various applications in mobile phones.</p>


